|                 Test Program to Build Boltzmann population                 |
|                                                                            |
\----------------------------------------------------------------------------/

This program builds a list of all vibrational states with a population above
a set threshold, compared to the vibrational ground state (set to 1).

NOTE: The Boltzmann populations are given relative to ground state's and not
      normalized.

